<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Statement Not Given</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Jon was quiet. â€œ...are you going to kill me?â€ &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The thing looked shocked. â€œOh, darling, no! And before you get any more awful ideas in your head, I didnâ€™t do anything to your friend. He simply had to go home and change out of wet clothes.â€ The thing rolled itâ€™s eyes, slouching grumpily in itâ€™s seat. â€œGoodness, where would you get that idea?â€&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;â€œWhatâ€¦â€ Jon paused. â€œWhat are you?â€&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The thing smiled, and the black aura appeared again. When it lifted, Jon couldnâ€™t keep in a yell, stumbling backwards and knocking over a pile of papers.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Something green and reptilian grinned at him, mouth filled with rows of sharp teeth. Itâ€™s eyes blinked sideways, like a lizard, and it tossed itâ€™s long blonde hair like a strange supermodel. It laughed, seeming to find Jonâ€™s reaction amusing. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;â€œReally, darling, thatâ€™s quite rude.â€ It shook a finger at Jon, as if scolding a child. A thick, green tail flicked, as if to accentuate the strangeness of this new guest. â€œNameâ€™s Double Trouble. Actor, espionage, pianist extraordinaire.â€&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
